// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Faathim 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Hero Text :
"P674560216" "{HeroName}. I greet you as Faathim, called Faathim the Kind. You have a noble aura about you, one that is only boosted by the temporary destruction of my brother, Ruladak.<br><br>Tell me what I can do to aid you."
// Answer Text :
"P1423838428" "I need to find Darrin Wade."
// Page HeroChoice1Page1 Text :
"P2816535020" "Darrin Wade. That is why you are here.<br><br><color orange>Faathim the Kind closes his eyes, seeking out Darrin Wade.</color><br><br>I know the man. He was outside of the Chantry. He helped Ruladak reform.<br><br>He is the one planning on bringing the Ravager into your world. He is the one who believes he can conquer Rularuu.<br><br>Perhaps he can, at the beginning. It is a clever plan, but one that will not work. He will be devoured by Rularuu, for that is what Rularuu does. Darrin Wade will maintain some control at first, but in the end, he will be consumed."
// Answer Text :
"P2147274399" "Where can I find him?"
// Page HeroChoice1FinalPage Text :
"P3052262776" "He is currently on an island in what you all call the Pacific Ocean.<br><br><color orange>Faathim the Kind gives you detailed information on where exactly you can find Darrin Wade.</color><br><br>I can only assume that he is close to completing his goals. You must hurry, {HeroName}. Time is of the essence."
// Answer Text :
"P310240002" "I will, Faathim, thank you."
// Page Villain Text :
"P3958960413" "{HeroName}. I greet you as Faathim, called Faathim the Kind. You have a vile aura around you, and yet you destroyed my weakened brother, Ruladak.<br><br>Are you here to destroy me, or do you seek information?"
// Answer Text :
"P2567076838" "Today I seek information, Faathim. Tell me where Darrin Wade is."
// Answer Text :
"P4099472815" "Do you know where Wade is?"
// Page VillainChoice1FinalPage Text :
"P4100827043" "Yes. He is currently on an island in what you all call the Pacific Ocean.<br><br><color orange>Faathim the Kind gives you detailed information on where exactly you can find Darrin Wade.</color><br><br>I can only assume that he is close to completing his goals. You must hurry, {HeroName}. Time is of the essence."
// Answer Text :
"P3724800357" "I'll handle this, Faathim."
// Page CompletedTF Text :
"P625820722" "I remember you well, {HeroName}. I will never forget your help in defeating Lanaru the Mad. While Ruladak has reformed, Lanaru has not.<br><br>You come here seeking aid, and I shall give it. Tell me what you wish to know, and I shall do what I can do aid you."
// Answer Text :
"P382069839" "Darrin Wade. Where is he?"
// Page CompletedTFChoice1Page1 Text :
"P2713785010" "<color orange>Faathim the Kind closes his eyes, seeking out Darrin Wade.</color><br><br>I know the man. He was outside of the Chantry. He helped Ruladak reform.<br><br>He is the one planning on bringing the Ravager into your world. He is the one who believes he can conquer Rularuu.<br><br>Perhaps he can, at the beginning. It is a clever plan, but one that will not work. He will be devoured by Rularuu, for that is what Rularuu does. Darrin Wade will maintain some control at first, but in the end, he will be consumed."
// Answer Text :
"P3851317019" "I'll do what I can, Faathim."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2813436849" "I've talked with Dark Watcher and Lady Grey about what Scirocco told you. They both agreed that this is the only lead we have, so we might as well take it.<br><br>We've adjusted one of our portals to send you inside the Shadow Shard. We couldn't get you directly inside the Chantry, due to the various power fluctuations in the area. You'll be what I call annoyingly close and problematically far away from the Chantry."
// AcceptString :
"P561326335" "... Great."
// SendOffString :
"P405548974" "Sorry, {HeroName}, it's the best we can do. One thing I don't understand, however, is why Wade would go visit Faathim. From what I understand, Faathim the Kind is the protector of those within the Shadow Shard; he isn't anything like Rularuu.  Why would someone like Darrin Wade go to a being like Faathim?"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3570498964" "Get Information from Faathim the Kind"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P566517749" "Watch out in the Shard, {HeroName}."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P391015799" "<color deepskyblue>Part 2: Into the Beast</color>"

