// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P697871190" "You've defeated Ruladak!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3759431707" "Faathim the Kind"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P114696569" "You've found out where Darrin Wade's main location is!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2397319666" "Good to see you're back, {HeroName}, things are getting worse by the hour. We've gotten word that Sydney is overrun with Rularuu monsters, while London is doing their best to fend them off. We've also gotten reports of strange activity in Warburg, but it's not the Rogue Arachnos.<br><br>Heroes from Paragon are being dispatched to the worse areas of the world, along with Vanguard, but we can't be everywhere at once.<br><br>You found where Darrin Wade is right now? That's great! We'll get a fleet of ships to go there at once.<br><br>Faathim the Kind warned you that Wade won't succeed? Well, of course. People like Wade <i>never</i> win, but I suppose he's hedging his bets that he'll be able to keep control over Rularuu even once everything is complete."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Penelope 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Hero Text :
"P219804675" "{HeroName}! Hey! This is pretty crazy, isn't it? I mean, all these mix of people here going to fight Darrin Wade! Jim and Nette are gonna be SO jealous that I got to come along!<br><br>I'm gonna do my best to take down Wade, you can count on it! I learned a lot from you when we were working together to rescue Sister Psyche. I've been practicing a lot with Numina, now that Sister Psyche is...<br><br>Ah, sorry. But, we've been practicing this really neat trick, it's like a protective barrier. Right now it, well, it still sort of lets enemies inside. But! But, it can block beams of energy! So if Wade tries to zap us down, you can count on me and Numina!"
// Answer Text :
"P3429184782" "Good to know."
// Page Villain Text :
"P2414631292" "Don't think I haven't forgotten you, {HeroName}. You're lucky I've been told to act nice, or I'd, well, I'd do something about you attacking me in Portal Corp, that's for sure!<br><br>You better just keep walking, because I don't associate with villains!"
// Answer Text :
"P1825683829" "Whatever you say."
// Page Neutral Text :
"P1570210403" "{HeroName}! Hey! This is pretty crazy, isn't it? I mean, all these mix of people here going to fight Darrin Wade! Jim and Nette are gonna be SO jealous that I got to come along!<br><br>I'm gonna do my best to take down Wade, you can count on it! I've been practicing a lot with Numina, now that Sister Psyche is...<br><br>Ah, sorry. But, we've been practicing this really neat trick, it's like a protective barrier. Right now it, well, it still sort of lets enemies inside. But! But, it can block beams of energy! So if Wade tries to zap us down, you can count on me and Numina!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Recluse 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Hero Text :
"P3919222008" "{HeroName}. So, you're the one who saw Marcus when he died.<br><br>This alliance does not signify a change of heart on my end. Darrin Wade is a threat too large to ignore. Understand this, {HeroName}. I have been trying most of my life to destroy Statesman. Wade has done what I could not, and this demands retaliation.<br><br>Wade's destruction by <i>my</i> hand is inevitable. Do not get in my way when the time comes."
// Answer Text :
"P588435808" "We'll see about that, Recluse."
// Page Villain Text :
"P194733205" "A villain through and through, {HeroName}. I had Arachnos investigate the scene to see how much you had to do with Statesman's death. They confirmed that Wade was the one who killed him, while you were the one who fought off Wade.<br><br>This alliance does not signify a change of heart on my end. Darrin Wade is a threat too large to ignore. Understand this, {HeroName}. I have been trying most of my life to destroy Statesman. Wade has done what I could not, and this demands retaliation.<br><br>Wade's destruction by <i>my</i> hand is inevitable. Do not get in my way when the time comes."
// Answer Text :
"P3322669959" "I could say the same to you, Recluse."
// Page Neutral Text :
"P3774439243" "{HeroName}. You should know that this alliance does not signify a change of heart on my end. Darrin Wade is a threat too large to ignore. Understand this, {HeroName}. I have been trying most of my life to destroy Statesman. Wade has done what I could not, and this demands retaliation.<br><br>Wade's destruction by <i>my</i> hand is inevitable. Do not get in my way when the time comes."
// Answer Text :
"P486994392" "We'll see about that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Liberty 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Hero Text :
"P2438034305" "Hey, {HeroName}. I don't think I ever got the chance to thank you for all your help in trying to save my mother. I've been so busy trying to track down Wade and... well, many other things, that I never thanked you.<br><br>I still think about her every day, but I know that nothing can be done now except making sure that Darrin Wade is brought to justice. We're going to make sure that he pays for everything he's done; for my mother, for my grandfather, for Sister Psyche... he won't get away with this."
// Answer Text :
"P1451247912" "I promise he won't, Liberty."
// Page Villain Text :
"P4188530389" "<color orange>Ms. Liberty remains silent, glaring at you.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"
// Page Neutral Text :
"P2984658645" "<color orange>Ms. Liberty seems to be in the middle of a thought. As you step towards her, she shakes her head, looking over towards you.</color><br><br>Sorry, {HeroName}, I was... just lost in thought. I have a lot on my mind... after all, it seems like I'm the last of the 'Cole' line, aren't I? Grandfather is gone... mother is gone...<br><br>Look... we're going to make sure that Darrin Wade pays for everything he's done; for my mother, for my grandfather, for Sister Psyche... he won't get away with any of this."
// Answer Text :
"P2277758284" "I know he won't, Liberty."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Numina 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Hero Text :
"P3168224173" "Ah, {HeroName}, it's great to see you again. My father extends his thanks for saving his... well, I suppose it's a little silly to say life, but I'll say it anyway. I won't ever forget how much you've done to help my family, I promise you that.<br><br>Have you spoken with Penelope Yin? She's come a long way since her time in Faultline. I believe her presence here will be a great help. We'll need everything we can get if we're to stop Darrin Wade... and the Phalanx, to be honest, is still shattered after losing both Psyche and Statesman."
// Answer Text :
"P3369255570" "Understandable."
// Page Villain Text :
"P3889657719" "<color orange>Numina remains silent when you walk over to her. She still hasn't forgotten your involvement in her father's kidnapping, it seems.</color>"
// Page Neutral Text :
"P1362234680" "Hello, {HeroName}. Have you spoken with Penelope Yin? She's come a long way since her time in Faultline. I believe her presence here will be a great help. We'll need everything we can get if we're to stop Darrin Wade... and the Phalanx, to be honest, is still shattered after losing both Psyche and Statesman."
// Answer Text :
"P3131772443" "Let's hope so."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3830847480" "<color orange>The computer connects you to the captain of the ship.</color><br><br>{HeroName}, we've got some odd readings that we're looking into. Something... definitely isn't right. We're getting - <br><br>What in the..."
// Answer Text :
"P3733956995" "What is it?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P2937683188" "We need you all up on the deck, NOW! Something VERY wrong is happening! Gaussian is getting to work on scanning <i>what</i> exactly is going up there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Mako 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P337469225" "Bug off, I got nothin' to say to you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P852254886" "We're all set to bring this thing to an end, {HeroName}. Vanguard has talked with a US Naval Fleet that's in the area near Wade's island.<br><br>We're planning an all out assault on the area. The first fleet has gone forward to begin the attack on the island, but they've reported information that's going to make this a little harder than we thought."
// AcceptString :
"P1513433315" "What information is that?"
// SendOffString :
"P477999598" "There's some sort of intense power fluctuations within the area, which makes flying a no-go. Anything in the air would get tossed about like a ragdoll by the huge forces that are in the air.<br><br>The only way to get to Wade's island is by a boat.<br><br>We're going to have Vanguard airlift you over to one of the farthest vessels and take you from there. Oh, I should also mention that you're not going alone.<br><br><color orange>Lord Recluse, Captain Mako, Penelope Yin, Numina, Ms. Liberty, and Gaussian</color> will be going there with you. Gaussian will be in charge of maintaining the ship. Recluse insisted on going along to finish off Wade himself, so you may run into some issues there. I'd keep my eye on Captain Mako; he'll have a huge advantage being in the ocean."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2372926423" "Assault Darrin Wade's Island"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1397370856" "Good luck, {HeroName}."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3119574227" "<color deepskyblue>Part 3: Coming Together</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1342275686" "You stepped off the Vanguard helicopter and into the ship. After spending a few hours wandering around, you return to the main area of the deck, waiting for information about Wade's island."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P2443491371" "Contact the ship captain via the computer for an update"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P1447401018" "Speak with anyone on board (optional)"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P2193062893" "Get topside to see the disturbance"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P2153641802" "Ascend to the USS Barry"
// Script Variable WaypointNames :
"P4003321876" "USS Barry"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P620010592" "Retrieve the USS Barry's computer data"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3279515557" "Fend off incoming Rularuu until Lady Grey can teleport the group to safety"
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P1756859898" "Penelope Yin"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P892451606" "I die!"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P1127431811" "Hello, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P2720100831" "Gaussian"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2409989984" "Now we fight"
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P2443023979" "Recluse"
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P4273719940" "Bane Spider Executioner"
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P1197895051" "Captain Mako"
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P194914344" "Ms. Liberty"
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P1575607881" "Numina"
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P4105117061" "Computer"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P24382257" "<t=20 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor LightSeaGreen>Gaussian here, I'm getting some extremely odd readings from that floating island.<t=10 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor LightSeaGreen>I'm not getting any signs of -human- life on those boats, Ms. Liberty.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor LightSeaGreen>If we can access the computer on the SS Barry, we can find out what they discovered about the island.<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor LightSeaGreen>However, the Barry is the highest ship on that pile, and I'm getting some readings of energy building up on that island."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P492869094" "<t=10 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor LightSeaGreen>We need some shields on this ship, NOW! There's a MAJOR energy build up coming from the island!<t=10 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor LightSeaGreen>Lady Grey is working on a spell to get us out of here! Wade is sending in a MASSIVE force of Rularuu, you need to hold them off!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1953559213" "<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor LightSlateGray>You all had the chance to walk away from this. You could've just LET me ascend to godhood!<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor LightSlateGray>But, no, like all supers, you just HAD to interfere! Don't you see?! This is for the best! <t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor LightSlateGray>I will be a perfect being, with the knowledge and power of Rularuu!<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor LightSlateGray>You'll all just have to be the last sacrifices made before my dreams become a reality!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3365089237" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor LightSeaGreen>Brace yourselves! The Rularuu are forming underwater to capsize the ship!<t=5 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Cornflowerblue>Are you outta your MIND? You're in SHARK territory now, Wade!<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor LightSlateGray>Please, do you think some-fish- is going to stop me?<t=10 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor LightSeaGreen>The whirlpools are diverting the Rularuu... and the current is going directly around the ship. Captain Mako... I must say, I'm impressed!<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor LightSeaGreen>Any second now, brace yourselves for teleport!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P12703486" "We can't just sit here and do nothing!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3245392036" "Oh, sure, throw {HeroName} to the sharks! Why don't you get Captain Mako to give {Hero.gender=male him|her} a hand?!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P19064157" "... Hrmph. Okay, well, {HeroName}, be careful! We've got your back on this ship!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1236407442" "Yeah, I got it boss. Don't go sailing off without me."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2384461736" "For Arachnos!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2808151008" "Lord Recluse"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P920610357" "Mako, go recover any information from those submerged boats."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3848863511" "We must rely on {HeroName} to get the data, while we defend the vessel."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2017731895" "Be my guest, but do you know what that magic could do to a ghost, my dear Numina?"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P1912466068" "Neither do I. {HeroName}, you have the spotlight, for now."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3309156764" "<t=5 d=5><t=40 d=5>Mako, go recover any information from those submerged boats.<t=10 d=5>{HeroName} must go recover the data. The rest of us need to defend this vessel at all costs.<t=5 d=5>Captain Mako is busy collecting data on the submerged ships, and {HeroName}, as much as I hate to admit, is more than capable of this."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3542240853" "<t=14 d=5><t=5 d=5>Wade! You may have killed Marcus, but you will not kill me! You are NOTHING compared to my might!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1349956927" "I've lost contact with Mako. I swear, if that fish has betrayed me...!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3275850909" "<t=15 d=5><t=23 d=5>We need to save whoever is left on those boats!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1496887232" "<t=10 d=5>Do your worst, Wade!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1866011309" "<t=40 d=5><t=10 d=5>No, I will go up there, I do not trust {HeroName} in the slightest!<t=5 d=5>..."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1034156241" "Vanguard HVAS"

