// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2174137138" "You found Darrin Wade's island and discovered that only an attack from some immense amount of force will be able to  destroy the forcefield that protects it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2835553050" "This is worse than we imagined, {HeroName}. Darrin Wade was able to take out an entire fleet with the power he has on that, well, <i>now</i> floating island. Penelope Yin and Numina are currently recovering from trying to block Darrin Wade's attacks on the ship.<br><br>From what we can tell, Wade's island is starting to ascend higher into space. He must be planning on using it as the stage to summon Rularuu into this world! But we just have one problem... how are we going to get past that shield? We'd need an entire city's worth of fire power to...<br><br>Wait! I know!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1820645408" "{HeroName}, it might be a stretch, but it's our only option left. We need to break down the barrier that's between us and Darrin Wade's island so we can get you and everyone else in there to stop him once and for all, right? According to the Barry's logs, they sent everything they had at the shields and barely dented them.<br><br>Well, what about Warburg? That place is armed to the teeth with more missiles than any one place in the world. If we wait for Wade's island to get into space, as the current trajectory is showing, then we can launch <i>everything</i> in Warburg to destroy the shield. Maybe we'll get lucky and it'll destroy Wade as well, but if not, well, then we have you that can deal with him."
// AcceptString :
"P1108929133" "What's the status of Warburg?"
// SendOffString :
"P4226024540" "That's the bad part. Lord Recluse sent Black Scorpion to Warburg to check the situation. That's sort of where I got the idea from. We just received word that several of Black Scoprion's men were wiped out by <color red>Malta Operatives</color>.<br><br>It looks like in the mess that was the world being attacked, Malta made a bid to take over Warburg. They're preparing for their own war in there, {HeroName}. Black Scorpion reported seeing nearly a dozen tanks being armed with their sapper technology. If we're going to use Warburg to take down Darrin Wade, you'll need to go in there with Black Scorpion and kick Malta out of there!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2818181747" "Retake Warburg from Malta"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P171350711" "Recluse claims Black Scorpion won't betray you while you're in there. Let's hope he's right."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P4265420051" "<color deepskyblue>Part 4: Warburg's Highest Purpose</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P407872528" "You arrive in Warburg to see Black Scorpion ready to fight. This may be a good thing, or a bad thing."
// Script Variable HERO_NAME :
"P4105631639" "Black Scorpion"
// Script Variable HERO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3730812893" "Malta! They're nothing, they can't do a THING to my power armor!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1738482053" "Nevermind"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2760894801" "Tank"

