"P3546237541" "You defeated Desert Black 5-1-2!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P94027804" "You've retaken Warburg!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4116130096" "Vanguard is already prepping every single missile in Warburg as we speak, {HeroName}. A lot is riding on this.<br><br>We have reports that Wade's island has broken through the Earth's atmosphere and is now hovering over the planet. Dark Watcher and Gaussian are reporting major spikes in energy around the area. We think that Wade is already beginning his ritual to bring Rularuu into the world and merge with him!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - LadyGrey 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1948276462" "{HeroName}. I will be providing you magical protection which will allow you to breath in space, if you do not already have the ability to do so.<br><br>We've just received word that the missiles have all hit Wade's island and have destroyed his shielding. <br><br>At this point, all that is left is to face off against Rula-Wade. I need to warn you, {HeroName}, that this may be an incredibly difficult fight. Recluse and his four patrons will be going with you, and we will be sending Penelope Yin up to give you support. Are you prepared to face off against Rula-Wade?"
// Answer Text :
"P102018090" "I am, let's finish this."
// Answer Text :
"P1800964957" "Tell Lord Recluse that he won't be coming with me."
// Page MoveForward Text :
"P2262759595" "Excellent. The entire eyes of the world are you on, {HeroName}. Good luck."
// Page NoHelpWarning Text :
"P3679962894" "Are you sure, {HeroName}? Lord Recluse and his patrons aren't exactly the most trustworthy of allies, but they are allies nonetheless. It will be incredibly difficult to face off against Rula-Wade without their help.<br><br><color orange>The finale mission will be much more challenging if you do not have the aid of Lord Recluse and his four patrons, especially if you are not on a team.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3477317724" "I'm sure I don't need their help."
// Answer Text :
"P4063242394" "On second thought, I'll take them. Let's finish this."
// Page ImSureMoveForward Text :
"P1859646012" "Very well. We'll just have to delay them while we get you into space."
// Answer Text :
"P70252942" "Excellent."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3150142934" "Everything is nearly set for you, {HeroName}. We just launched the entire arsenal of Warburg rockets at Darrin Wade's island. We expect that some of them will be destroyed by Wade, but we're confident that enough will hit the shield to destroy it.<br><br>Vanguard has a rocket prepared for you deep within the base to launch you out there to face off against Wade once and for all. There's... just something you should be aware of."
// AcceptString :
"P712521273" "What is that?"
// SendOffString :
"P818538004" "We believe that <color orange>Wade has already begun to merge with Rularuu.</color> He is no longer Darrin Wade. He's a sort of cross between Wade and Rularuu. We've given him the code name 'Rula-Wade'.<br><br>Also, Lord Recluse has insisted that he and his four patrons accompany you to face off against Wade, and Lady Grey wants to debrief you before you go up.<br><br>If you have a problem with Recluse going with you, I would bring it up with Lady Grey."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1390311518" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: Unstoppable Force</color>"

