"P2767398695" "Vanguard's rocket flies over the island, dropping you down to face off against Darrin Wade's new form."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P2807614105" "This is what you tell the player to do."
// Script Variable WaypointNames :
"P303756709" "Name"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3383608100" "Nothing"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2045469489" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor LightSlateGray>Enough! I'm done toying with you, BEGONE!<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor LightSlateGray>Hrmph... so, you're still standing, {HeroName}? Why must you stand in the way of change?<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Black>This is Lady Grey, come in, {HeroName}. You must hang in there, for all our sakes.<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Black>Penelope Yin is almost to the island, she'll provide support against Wade's Apocalypse Beam.<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Black>The Rularuu artifacts should be vulnerable now, destroy them and you'll weaken Wade!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4251229235" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor LightSlateGray>How dare... those artifacts, the power they contained! The KNOWLEDGE! You couldn't understand, could you?<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor LightSlateGray>I know all that Rularuu knows, {HeroName}! All the errors of mankind, all of the powers that exist in the world! I KNOW it!<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor LightSlateGray>I would control the world, I would SAVE this existence from all who would DARE cause us danger!<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor LightSlateGray>I will not let YOU stand in the way of my ascension to godhood, to freedom!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2557614818" "I... will... NOT... be STOPPED!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P508829928" "You'll regret the day you began this plan, Wade. I'll make sure of it!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2733519639" "{HeroName}, you and I shall end this, once and for all!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4078223098" "What the?!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3737616108" "What is this?!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1161056334" "Bah!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4164389544" "My Lord Recluse...!"

