// 5 Actor1 :
"P2416245551" "{HeroName}. I had a feeling you were behind the rockets that attacked the island."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P2979592750" "As we speak, I'm becoming one with Rularuu. I am ascending, becoming MORE than a man, even more than a god!"
// 5 Actor1 :
"P2405897714" "They told me my desire for greatness could never be satisfied, that my nature was to be a mere human..."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P928606071" "But I have defied them, defied nature, defied all that would hold me down!"
// 5 Actor1 :
"P1097108204" "This world, this universe... now belongs to ME! And it has NO place for the likes of YOU!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_1_NAME :
"P680037663" "Rula-Wade"
// Script Variable ACTOR_2_NAME :
