"P1142715468" "<shout>I've done... all I can... I'm sorry... {HeroName}...!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P57532914" "I am more than a match for you, even with a fraction of Rularuu's power!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P300803613" "All of this knowledge, {HeroName}! It's made me realize what must be done, to save myself and the world."
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1629904603" "The first step involves eliminating beings like YOU from this existence."
