// 5 Actor1 :
"P3967296310" "<em CitizensPsionicReaction>NO! The power... falling away! This isn't happening! WHY?!"
// 5 Actor1 :
"P3753292082" "Was it so wrong to want freedom?! To want KNOWLEDGE?!"
// 5 Actor1 :
"P2828283627" "All I ever wanted... was to just know the world... know the universe... to be... free...!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
