// Dialog :
"P4220750397" "You've stopped Rula-Wade and saved all of existence from Rularuu!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P326612130" "Every person in the world just let out a huge sigh of relief, {HeroName}. The monsters of Rularuu are starting to vanish all over the world. With Wade defeated, Rularuu was flung back into the depths of the Shadow Shard.<br><br>Vanguard recovered what remains of Darrin Wade. He was violently flung back into his body after you defeated his ascended form. He no longer has the powers of Statesman and Sister Psyche, though to be honest, we're not entirely sure how that happened.<br><br>The world is saved and Wade's plot is at an end. However, there's still one last thing we need from you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - PressConference 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1486735364" "<color orange>You step up to the podium and look over the numerous reporters who are present. All of them want to know the truth behind everything you've done with Darrin Wade and the Freedom Phalanx.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1609882463" "I'll be taking your questions now."
// Answer Text :
"P1265102509" "I don't have time for questions, good day."
// Answer Text :
"P358354934" "(Attack the press conference!)"
// Page Decline Text :
"P2403380671" "<color orange>The reporters try to ask you questions, but you wave a hand, indicating that the conference is finished.</color>"
// Page ConferenceIsOver Text :
"P3614983989" "<color orange>You step away from the podium, indicating that the conference is finished.</color>"
// Page Attack Text :
"P1777133893" "<color orange>You lash out and attack the conference!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page VillainSigArc1 Text :
"P2720379851" "Tell us about your involvement with Synapse and Darrin Wade's obelisk.<br><br>Why did you take Synapse's power, and were you planning on killing him?"
// Answer Text :
"P1760016090" "I was merely testing the limits of the obelisk. Nothing more. Next question."
// Answer Text :
"P3427052803" "I was infiltrating Wade's plan and had to play the part. Next question."
// Answer Text :
"P809170518" "If I had not done that, Synapse would have died. Next question."
// Answer Text :
"P3605218311" "(Attack the press!)"
// Answer Text :
"P2908335409" "This conference is over, no more questions!"
// Page HeroSigArc1 Text :
"P2650579540" "Tell us about your involvement with Synapse and Darrin Wade's obelisk!<br><br>Synapse said you were the one who saved his life. How much involvement did you have in this?"
// Answer Text :
"P2117969771" "Synapse did his best under the situation, but I was happy to help him. Next question."
// Answer Text :
"P1391571212" "The obelisk was a clear trap, and shows how the Phalanx was losing their edge. Next question."
// Answer Text :
"P3252293733" "This was all part of Wade's plan, luckily Synapse got away safely. Next question."
// Page VillainSigArc2 Text :
"P3549168365" "Why did you steal the skull of Numina's father? Were you working together with the Rulu-Shin at the time, or did you have alternate motives?"
// Answer Text :
"P2188194255" "I was using her father to get to the Rulu-Shin and stop them. Next question."
// Answer Text :
"P2256313551" "The Rulu-Shin were a means to an end to find Wade's plans. Next question."
// Answer Text :
"P1638197498" "Desperate times call for desperate measures, I did what I had to do. Next question."
// Answer Text :
"P3594755289" "(Attack the press conference)"
// Answer Text :
"P770920571" "The conference is over, no more questions."
// Page HeroSigArc2 Text :
"P1819246635" "You are known for helping to save Numina's father from the cult called the Rulu-Shin. What can you tell us about your experience and the role the Midnighters played?"
// Answer Text :
"P2110484827" "The Midnighters were a great help, I couldn't have done it without them."
// Answer Text :
"P1526639597" "The Midnighters were weakened, so I stepped up to give them a hand during this time."
// Answer Text :
"P2718675355" "The Midnighters are a shell of their former selves. They would've been destroyed, if not for me."
// Answer Text :
"P717337086" "This conference is over, no more questions."
// Page VillainSigArc3 Text :
"P2355570440" "The public has debated about whether or not you or Darrin Wade were responsible for the death of Alexis Cole-Duncan.<br><br>Can you answer once and for all who killed Alexis Cole-Duncan?"
// Answer Text :
"P140628072" "I killed her. Next question."
// Answer Text :
"P1043704673" "Darrin Wade was responsible for her death."
// Answer Text :
"P2815917441" "No comment. Next question."
// Answer Text :
"P626186509" "No more questions, this conference is over."
// Page HeroSigArc3 Text :
"P1762109239" "Regarding the scenario with Alexis Cole-Duncan's death. We understand you did your best in the situation. There has been much blame pinned on Manticore for trying to keep this a secret.<br><br>Can you give us a comment regarding Manticore's actions during this crisis?"
// Answer Text :
"P3441752377" "Manticore was doing what he thought was right. That's all you can ask."
// Answer Text :
"P3393030546" "Manticore's actions were questionable, but I was there to help."
// Answer Text :
"P4013817126" "This is a sign that Manticore's time is about up. He's losing his edge."
// Page VillainSigArc4 Text :
"P146646111" "We were told by Aurora Borealis that you played a <i>very</i> heavy role in the attack on Sister Psyche's mind.<br><br>What was your goal in doing this?"
// Answer Text :
"P1198875715" "Psyche wrongly trapped another woman in there. I was simply trying to free her."
// Answer Text :
"P2063990970" "I was trying to cut her off before something horrible happened."
// Answer Text :
"P2116125553" "I was simply trying to save Malaise before Psyche viciously killed him."
// Page HeroSigArc4 Text :
"P3978982321" "Can you give us more information about the fate of Malaise in Sister Psyche's mind? We understand that he was killed trying to split Psyche's personality apart."
// Answer Text :
"P3379715360" "Malaise was insane, but I believe he could have been saved, like he was once before."
// Answer Text :
"P1687297884" "Sister Psyche did what she had to do. Malaise went out of control."
// Answer Text :
"P4132585159" "Malaise was a major player in all of this. He deserved a worse fate."
// Page VillainSigArc5 Text :
"P3244687850" "Statesman's death. Everyone's talking about it. We know that you were present for his death and that you supposedly fought Darrin Wade.<br><br>Can you clarify what exactly happened there?"
// Answer Text :
"P2145735798" "I was undercover and about to attack Wade, but I was too late to save Statesman."
// Answer Text :
"P963197648" "I attacked Wade, but I was too late to save Statesman's life."
// Answer Text :
"P3999786090" "I tried to put down Wade after he gained Statesman's powers, but he fled."
// Answer Text :
"P3773817177" "(Attack the conference!)"
// Page HeroSigArc5 Text :
"P3608740496" "Statesman's death. We all know that you were present, that you did your best to fight Darrin Wade.<br><br>Who can the world turn to, now that Statesman is dead?"
// Answer Text :
"P1179619548" "Statesman will live on in all the heroes of Paragon. We are who they can turn to."
// Answer Text :
"P3550635203" "Statesman hasn't been a factor for a while. The heroes of Paragon will protect the people."
// Answer Text :
"P949601817" "The people can turn to me. I will be there, no matter what, to protect them."
// Page VillainSigArc6 Text :
"P4106235007" "Is it true that Sister Psyche saved the portion of Aurora Borealis that was trapped in her mind moments before her death? Were you there trying to save Aurora, or Psyche?"
// Answer Text :
"P3675216292" "I was there to save Sister Psyche, but I was too late, given Manticore's foolish actions."
// Answer Text :
"P3365772962" "I was there for Aurora, but Psyche's sacrifice was a noble one."
// Page HeroSigArc6 Text :
"P893023915" "Sister Psyche's death was a tragedy, there is no question about that.<br><br>What is your judgment regarding Manticore's actions? Was he right in killing his own wife?"
// Answer Text :
"P643449517" "Manticore was forced to make a horrible decision to save Paragon."
// Answer Text :
"P3879952968" "Manticore was in a difficult state. He was nervous and made the wrong choice."
// Answer Text :
"P684526453" "It's time for him to resign and let the true heroes take his place."
// Page FinalQuestion Text :
"P1545000608" "Why did you save the world from Rula-Wade? What motivated you to do all of this?"
// Answer Text :
"P2144462198" "The world needed to be saved. Someone had to step up."
// Answer Text :
"P2087815015" "Darrin Wade had to pay for his crimes, no matter what."
// Answer Text :
"P4233315626" "What's better press than saving the world from an omnipotent being?"
// Answer Text :
"P2881262291" "The world will be mine one day, I need it here in one piece."
// Page CivilFinish Text :
"P1832339950" "<color orange>You nod to the remaining reporters as the press conference is finished.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Infernia 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Attacked Text :
"P160896879" "<color orange>Infernia scowls at you.</color><br><br>Stay away from me, {HeroName}! I should've known you were nothing but a lunatic! Why we <i>ever</i> trusted you is beyond me.<br><br>The next time you and I meet, I'll make sure that you're taken down, before you become something worse than Wade ever was."
// Page Regular Text :
"P3787105082" "Well, {HeroName}, it's all finally over now. Lady Grey has ordered a squadron of Vanguard to stay with Darrin Wade at all times.<br><br>From the reports I received, his mind is extremely damaged at this point. Wade barely remembers what happened, or who he even is.<br><br>However, somewhere within the confines of his mind is the knowledge of Rularuu, something which we can all make good use of.<br><br>If there's anything left of the original Darrin Wade, it's now trapped within the husk that is his body. I would feel sad for him, if I didn't think he got off <i>lightly</i>.<br><br>I know people have already said this, {HeroName}, but thank you, for everything. The world is safe, well, as safe as it was before Darrin Wade, all thanks to you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2151191504" "Like I said, the entire world wants to know what happened with Darrin Wade. And, {HeroName}, with everything that has gone down this entire time, they want to hear it straight from <i>you</i>."
// AcceptString :
"P3608819099" "What are you trying to say?"
// SendOffString :
"P2120106981" "The press has gathered in one of our conference rooms and want to get your comments on everything that has happened along the way.<br><br>If you don't want to participate, you can feel free to just go up there, say a few words, and then leave. However, this is your chance for the spotlight, if you want. You've just saved the world from Rula-Wade. Maybe you want to clear things up, or maybe you want to do, I don't know, something else.<br><br>We'll have some Vanguard officials there providing security for you."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3903930841" "Attend the Press Conference"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3520075981" "They're all waiting for you, {HeroName}."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3368362153" "<color deepskyblue>Epilogue</color>"

