// 3 Caption :
"P3934892802" "<x=0.5 y=0.1 t=4 d=7><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>The world is saved from Darrin Wade..."
// 5 Caption :
"P1415656917" "<x=0.5 y=0.3 t=4 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>But what about all the others who were part of this journey?"
// 4 Caption :
"P4004305781" "<x=0.3 y=0.3 t=9 d=9><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>Theoden agreed to help the PPD against the Lost after being abandoned by his kindred. "
// 5 Caption :
"P873297782" "<x=0.8 y=0.3 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor FireBrick>Alastor continues his quest to create the world's most powerful artifact..."
// 4 Caption :
"P2989529544" "<x=0.2 y=0.3 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>The Midnighter Club agreed to an alliance with Luddites, nominating Michael Binocolo as their representative "
// 5 Caption :
"P347808909" "<x=0.8 y=0.3 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor FireBrick>Vladimir Zolner is keeping tabs on the Rulu-Shin, Arachnos, and a scientist named Dmitry Krylov."
// 4 Caption :
"P4138086614" "<x=0.2 y=0.3 t=13 d=13><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>Agent Kwahu was pardoned for his bungling of the Warburg Conference and his transfer to Siberia was called off. "
// 4 Caption :
"P2220988538" "<x=0.5 y=0.1 t=9 d=9><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor FireBrick>During the chaos after Statesman's death, Marshal Blitz was broken out of the Zig by an unknown group..."
// 5 Caption :
"P677647042" "<x=0.8 y=0.3 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor FireBrick>After hearing of Marshal Blitz's escape, Gossamer began her search to find her former leader."
// 5 Caption :
"P2042280455" "<x=0.3 y=0.3 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>Dakota Berg's debt was forgiven after his help with the Darrin Wade case."
// 4 Caption :
"P2950240558" "<x=0.3 y=0.3 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>Unfortunately, he gained it all back after a drunken night of celebrating."
// 5 Caption :
"P3898950394" "<x=0.8 y=0.3 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor FireBrick>The Aurora Borealis from Psyche's mind remains in the body of Tyrka. Her plans for the future are unknown."
// 4 Caption :
"P1428350750" "<x=0.2 y=0.3 t=9 d=9><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>Glacia has been given permission to go back into the field and fight crime."
// 5 Caption :
"P345659706" "<x=0.8 y=0.3 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor FireBrick>Leo Poggiani took over Blackbeard's tavern in Port Oakes and now makes sure no hero goes near it.."
// 4 Caption :
"P467324488" "<x=0.2 y=0.3 t=9 d=9><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>Specialist Greer is working on creating a hyper-advanced suit of armor to become a super hero in the PPD, much like Blue Steel."
// 5 Caption :
"P3313635779" "<x=0.8 y=0.3 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor FireBrick>Protector Z-958 has begun to exhibit some odd behavior after being controlled by Aurora Borealis. Crey is unsure what to do with this current model."
// 4 Caption :
"P3798625181" "<x=0.2 y=0.2 t=13 d=13><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>After Statesman's death, Positron was nominated to be the new leader of the Freedom Phalanx. "
// 4 Caption :
"P1410906299" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=8 d=8><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>Ms. Liberty renewed her cause to try to redeem Lord Recluse."
// 5 Caption :
"P1055748318" "<x=0.8 y=0.2 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>Penelope Yin was inducted as the newest, and youngest, member of the Freedom Phalanx."
// 4 Caption :
"P493866685" "<x=0.5 y=0.4 t=4 d=4><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>As for Darrin Wade..."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P3986037201" "<t=5 d=5>Well, Mr. Wade. You've caused the world quite a deal of trouble."
// 3 Actor1 :
"P3016633674" "<t=5 d=5>Urgh... you..."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P3575627052" "<t=5 d=5>You've talked enough, Mr. Wade. Allow me to go on."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P3563202542" "<t=5 d=5>Without Statesman and Sister Psyche's powers, you're just a very mortal man."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P2505969391" "<t=5 d=5>The world wants you dead, but I think your pathetic excuse for a life can still serve a purpose."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P1731159846" "<t=5 d=5>We're going to pry everything you discovered from Rularuu out of your brain, Mr. Wade."
// Script Variable ACTOR_1_NAME :
"P3399251172" "Darrin Wade"
// Script Variable ACTOR_2_NAME :
"P510700898" "Lady Grey"

